:CMD: config R0 interface loopback lo0
:CMD: config R0 router-id 122.1.1.0
:CMD: config R0 interface loopback lo0 ip-address 122.1.1.0 32
:CMD: config R0 protocol isis interface all
:CMD: config R0 protocol isis source-packet-routing mpls
:CMD: config R0 protocol isis source-packet-routing mpls node-sid 1000
:CMD: config R0 protocol isis redistribute connected
:CMD: config R0 protocol isis traceoptions file-logging
:CMD: config R0 protocol isis traceoptions all

