:CMD: config R0 no protocol isis interface eth1
:CMD: config R0 no interface ethernet eth1 ip-address 192.168.0.2 24
:CMD: config R0 no interface ethernet eth1 vrf 0
:CMD: config R0 vrf red
:CMD: config R0 interface ethernet eth1 vrf red
:CMD: config R0 interface ethernet eth1 ip-address 192.168.0.2 24
:CMD: config R0 vrf red protocol isis
:CMD: config R0 vrf red protocol isis interface eth1
:CMD: config R0 vrf red protocol isis redistribute bgp vrf red
